        "heading_UF6Ade": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>How to choose the right lens strength when sphere-only lenses can't correct your CYL and fully custom ones are $300-$500!</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_cRCUTN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you have astigmatism, buying a prescription snorkel mask gets confusing fast. Your glasses prescription shows SPH, CYL, and AXIS, but most off-the-shelf mask lenses are sphere-only, they correct nearsightedness or farsightedness (SPH) but don't directly correct astigmatisms (CYL or AXIS).</p><p>So here's what we're actually trying to do:</p><p>Get your vision clear enough to enjoy the ocean and comfortable enough to explore the water for longer.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "button_LzWhcY": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Shop Prescription Masks",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/all-our-masks",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
