      "name": "Quick pick lens summary",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;\n            padding: 20px;\n            background-color: #023059;\n        }\n        \n        .container {\n            max-width: 1000px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n        }\n        \n        h2 {\n            color: #023059;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            font-size: 24px;\n        }\n        \n        h3 {\n            color: #B95E05;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            font-size: 20px;\n        }\n        \n        table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n        }\n        \n        th {\n            background-color: #023059;\n            color: white;\n            padding: 15px;\n            text-align: left;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        \n        td {\n            padding: 15px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #023059;\n            font-size: 15px;\n        }\n        \n        tr:hover {\n            background-color: #f8f9fa;\n        }\n        \n        tr:last-child td {\n            border-bottom: none;\n        }\n        \n        .cyl-value {\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: #023059;\n        }\n        \n        .note {\n            background-color: #B95E05;\n            border-left: 4px solid #B95E05;\n            padding: 15px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            color: #ffffff;\n        }\n        \n        .note strong {\n            color: #ffffff;\n        }\n        \n        .section-divider {\n            height: 2px;\n            background-color: #023059;\n            margin: 30px 0;\n            opacity: 0.2;\n        }\n        \n        .lens-type-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 4px 12px;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        \n        .minus-badge {\n            background-color: #023059;\n            color: white;\n        }\n        \n        .plus-badge {\n            background-color: #023059;\n            color: white;\n        }\n        \n        @media (max-width: 600px) {\n            th, td {\n                padding: 10px;\n                font-size: 14px;\n            }\n            \n            h2 {\n                font-size: 20px;\n            }\n            \n            h3 {\n                font-size: 18px;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <h2>Quick Lens Pick Summary</h2>\n        \n        <!-- NEARSIGHTED SECTION -->\n        <h3><span class=\"lens-type-badge minus-badge\">Nearsighted (Minus −)</span></h3>\n        <p><strong>Start with your SPH value for each eye.</strong></p>\n        <p>Then adjust based on your CYL level:</p>\n        \n        <table>\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <th>Your CYL</th>\n                    <th>Recommendation</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"cyl-value\">0.00 – 0.75</td>\n                    <td>Start <strong>0.25 to 0.50 weaker</strong> than <strong>SPH</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"cyl-value\">1.00 – 1.75</td>\n                    <td>Start at <strong>SPH</strong> or <strong>0.25 weaker</strong> max</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"cyl-value\">2.00 – 3.00</td>\n                    <td>Start at <strong>SPH</strong>; consider one <strong>0.25 stronger</strong> for sharpness</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"cyl-value\">3.25+</td>\n                    <td>Start at <strong>SPH</strong>; consider <strong>0.25-0.50 stronger</strong> for sharpness</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n        \n        <div class=\"note\">\n            <strong>Remember:</strong> Stronger can be sharper but may increase eye strain. Comfort vs. crisp is your choice.\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"section-divider\"></div>\n        \n        <!-- FARSIGHTED SECTION -->\n        <h3><span class=\"lens-type-badge plus-badge\">Farsighted (Plus +)</span></h3>\n        <p><strong>Start with your SPH value for each eye.</strong></p>\n        <p>Our farsighted lenses come in whole number steps only: <strong>+1.00, +2.00, +3.00, +4.00, +5.00</strong></p>\n        <p>Round based on your CYL level:</p>\n        \n        <table>\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <th>Your CYL</th>\n                    <th>Recommendation</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"cyl-value\">0.00 – 1.75</td>\n                    <td><strong>Round down</strong> to nearest whole number for comfort</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"cyl-value\">2.00+</td>\n                    <td>Round to <strong>nearest whole number</strong> with comfort tie-break:<br>\n                        • If SPH ends in .25 or .50 → round <strong>down</strong><br>\n                        • If SPH ends in .75 → round <strong>up</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n        \n        <div class=\"note\">\n            <strong>Special cases:</strong> If your prescription is +0.50 or +0.75, we recommend starting with +1.00 for optimal underwater vision.\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
